  "mmd": "%% Figure 16-2 — Gateway evaluation and denied decision\n%% The refund service proposes a mutation, but the Gateway enforcement point receives a denial from the policy evaluator and records the decision. No execution token or external ledger request is issued.\nsequenceDiagram\n participant A as Agent\n participant S as Refund service\n participant P as Gateway PEP\n participant D as Policy evaluator\n participant E as Evidence store\n participant L as Refund ledger\n A->>S: proposes refund\n S->>P: requests mutation\n P->>D: requests decision\n D-->>P: returns DENY\n P->>E: records decision\n P-->>S: returns denial\n Note over L: No call\n Note over P,D: Scope FAIL; conflict FAIL; approval ABSENT\n",
  "alt": "The refund service proposes a mutation, but the Gateway enforcement point receives a denial from the policy evaluator and records the decision. No execution token or external ledger request is issued."
}
